If you want your web site to store and retrieve data from a 
database, your web server must have access to a database-system.

If your web server is hosted by an Internet Service Provider (ISP), you will have to look for SQL hosting plans.

Some common SQL hosting databases are MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, and Oracle.

MySQL is a popular database software for web sites.

MySQL is known for speed, reliability, and ease of use.

MySQL is an inexpensive 
alternative to the expensive Microsoft and Oracle solutions.

